  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **The package follows `IInterprocessObject<T>` into Compze.Threading.Interprocess: `Compze.InterprocessObject.MemoryPack` is `Compze.Threading.Interprocess.MemoryPack`,** and depends on Compze.Threading.Interprocess instead of the retired Compze.InterprocessObject. `MemoryPackInterprocessObject` is unchanged but for its namespace, which was `Compze.InterprocessObject.MemoryPack`. To upgrade, replace a reference to Compze.InterprocessObject.MemoryPack with one to this package, and `using Compze.InterprocessObject.MemoryPack;` with `using Compze.Threading.Interprocess.MemoryPack;`. Its earlier versions, up to 0.6.0-alpha, were published as [Compze.InterprocessObject.MemoryPack](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Compze.InterprocessObject.MemoryPack/).",
